\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Iceland \highlight\uc2  to support crown via market  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 171 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Februar 2013\par 10:17\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 STOCKHOLM, Feb 6 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Iceland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Wednesday it planned to support the crown \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  via \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  after it temporarily suspended its regular \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases from market makers.\par \par \uc2 Since September 2010, the bank had purchased foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a weekly basis. It in total bought 20 billion crowns ($157.47 million) of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and sold foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  worth 3 billion crowns. But it in January suspended the purchases as the crown had fallen.\par \par \uc2 "In view of these conditions, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has decided to suspend its programme of regular foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases for the time being and support the crown through \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," it said a statement after a monetary policy meeting where it kept its key rate steady at 6.0 percent.\par \par \uc2 It also said there was considerable uncertainty about the exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 ($1 = 127.0050 Iceland kronas)\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Patrick Lannin)\par \par \uc2 ICELAND-CROWN/ (URGENT) | ABN | D | M | DA | FN | NW | SW   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020130209e92600031\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex10