\par\par \b \uc2 *DJ Iceland Ctrl Bk: ISK Has Remained Broadly Stable Since Nov\b0\par\par\uc2 296 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Dezember 2009\par 12:15\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2009, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 10 Dec 2009 06:16 EDT *DJ  \b \highlight22\uc2 Iceland\b0 \highlight\uc2  Ctrl Bk: No ISK \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Needed Since Early Nov\par \par \uc2 10 Dec 2009 06:17 EDT *DJ  Iceland Ctrl Bk: Short-term Capital Flow Uncertainties Remain\par \par \uc2 10 Dec 2009 06:19 EDT *DJ  Iceland Ctrl Bk: Limited Risk Of Second-Round Inflation Effects\par \par \uc2 10 Dec 2009 06:20 EDT *DJ  Iceland Ctrl Bk: Sees Scope For Further Monetary Easing\par \par \uc2 10 Dec 2009 06:20 EDT *DJ  Iceland Ctrl Bk: Further Easing Depends On ISK Stability, Inflation\par \par \uc2 10 Dec 2009 06:44 EDT DJ  Iceland \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Sees Scope For Further Monetary Easing\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Anna Molin \par    Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Iceland's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Thursday said it may continue to chop its key lending rate if inflation carries on falling and the relative stability of the Icelandic krona is maintained.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "If the krona remains stable or appreciates, and if inflation continues to fall as forecast, there should be scope for continued gradual monetary easing," Sedlabanki said in a statement.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The bank earlier Thursday cut its key policy rate by one percentage point for the second consecutive month, as it seeks to bolster its economy amid \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  weakness and the gradual lifting of capital controls.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  said the Icelandic krona has remained broadly stable since its last policy meeting, and it hasn't needed to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to support the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  since early November.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Inflation has also dropped in line with forecasts, falling to 8.6% year-on-year in November, it said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Agency Web site: \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.sedlabanki.is"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.sedlabanki.is}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Anna Molin, Dow Jones Newswires; +46 8 545 130 91; anna.molin@dowjones.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 December 10, 2009 06:44 ET (11:44 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020091210e5ca002fy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
