\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Iceland \highlight\uc2  c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  to help falling crown. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Jon Svanur Johansson \par \uc2 387 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2001\par 19:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  REYKJAVIK, March 26 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Iceland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Monday for the second straight session to support the falling Icelandic crown, but with limited success, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought 1.6 billion Icelandic crowns for some $18 million, the same amount as on Friday, to protect the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's daily trading band, set according to a inverted trade-weighted index. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the sixth since the start of the year, initially boosted the crown to 122.3 points on the index from 123.15, but the crown then slipped back to 123.00 at close. \par \par \uc2  The higher the number of the index, the weaker the crown. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's daily trading band has its lower end at 125.36 points of the index and the upper end at 104.66 points. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was trying to protect the trading band, but there is a lot of pessimism in the air and there was heavy crown selling right after the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Halldor Hildimundarson, \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Islandsbanki-FBA said. \par \par \uc2  The failure of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to substantially boost the crown sparked market speculation that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would scrap the trading band altogether at its policy meeting of the board on Tuesday and free-float the unit. \par \par \uc2  "If they scrap the band, they will have to step in again with a really massive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop the crown from falling through the floor," one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The crown has been on a downward path since May last year on fears about its long-term stability caused by the country's high dependence on fish exports as well as by outflows for foreign loan repayments and swap closures. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that one of the measures the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could take to support the crown would be to cut interest rates, because it would help the economy as a whole at a time of a global slowdown. \par \par \uc2  After several rises last year, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's key repo rate now stands at 11.4 percent. The bank said earlier in March it would consider a cut if there was more evidence of an economic slowdown. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not available for comment. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010713dx3q035a2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
