\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Iceland \highlight\uc2  cenbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  anew as crown falls more. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Jon Svanur Johansson \par \uc2 398 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Januar 2001\par 15:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  REYKJAVIK, Jan 25 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Iceland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for the second day in a row, buying one billion Icelandic crowns ($11.51 million) to halt the crown's recent slide. \par \par \uc2  Iceland's inverted trade-weighted \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  index rose further - meaning the crown weakened more - hitting a peak of 122.6 by 1330 GMT compared with a high of 122.58 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  At 1448 GMT, the index stood at 122.40. \par \par \uc2  The bank said in a statement on Wednesday it had sold about two billion crowns worth of dollars to prop up the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has fallen close to the 125.36 lower limit of a fluctuation band with a central rate of 115.01. \par \par \uc2  "Our \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves are large so we can stretch them for a fairly long time. All in all we are very prepared for further \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Birgir Isleifur Gunnarsson, one of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's three governors, told Reuters on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  He said no decisions had been made about further \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Analysts say fisheries-dependent \b \highlight22\uc2 Iceland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's crown has fallen out of favour due to scant investor confidence in its longer-term stability. The crown has also been dented by \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  outflows stemming from foreign loan repayments and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap closures. \par \par \uc2  Sigurgeir Jonsson, head of derivatives at Icelandic investment bank Kaupthing, said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's actions were logical and in line with established policy. \par \par \uc2  "I believe that if the crown continues to weaken and the index starts getting dangerously close to the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  band limit, we will witness much stronger \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  than we have seen thus far," Jonsson said. "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been very determined to protect the limits.". \par \par \uc2  "Although the crown may weaken to some extent in the next few months I do believe that if the economy does not suddenly start to worsen the bank's measures will turn out to be satisfactory," Jonsson said. \par \par \uc2  "But if the economy does begin to drop, these \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  will not be enough," he said. \par \par \uc2  Gunnarsson said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was keeping a close eye on the crown. \par \par \uc2  "I simply cannot say what will happen next as no decisions have been made... But I can say that we are not planning any actions whatsoever at this point," he said. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010713dx1p0743g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
