n weakening since the end of April, but in the last few days the rate of decline has increased. \par \par \uc2  In July the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was forced to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily and even suspend \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market trading after the crown fell through 112 on the index. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010713dx1o06vro\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
