\par\par \b \uc2  Iceland crown weakens further, rate rise seen. \b0\par\par\uc2 284 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Juli 2000\par 12:07\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  REYKJAVIK, July 14 (Reuters) - Iceland's crown weakened in early trading on Friday following two days of heavy buying by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and a suspension of trading on Thursday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The continuing weakness, despite \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  totalling some $37 million on Thursday, prompted many in the market to expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to take further measures such as a steep rise in interest rates. \par \par \uc2  At 1000 GMT the crown was trading at 79.56 bid per dollar, down from 79.12 at Thursday's close. \par \par \uc2  On its inverse trade-weighted index it fell to about 114.85 from Thursday's closing 114.19. \par \par \uc2  The slide in the crown has been prompted by worries about inflation in the booming economy. The immediate crisis was prompted by a decline in the crown triggering stop-loss orders by corporates hedging foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  borrowings. \par \par \uc2  Bunadarbanki Islands hf (Agricultural Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Iceland\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) said in its daily newsletter that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the crown over the past two days had totalled some four billion Iceland crowns ($50.5 million). \par \par \uc2  "These are considerable amounts in the light of the effect on the market, although the crown might have weakened even more in the last couple of days had the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," it said. \par \par \uc2  "An interest hike of up to 100 points can be expected in the near future." \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last raised its repo rate in June, to 10.6 percent from 10.1 percent, taking the cumulative rise in the rate to 3.4 percentage points in about two years. ((Jonathan Lynn, Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1004, fax +46-8-211601, stockholm.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010820dw7e01tuy\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (iceland near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\